{"code":"PK15","wikidata":"Q16307599","wikipedia":{"en":"Rajabhat Phranakhon MRT station","th":"สถานีราชภัฏพระนคร"},"summary":{"en":"Rajabhat Phranakhon station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Pink Line. The station is located on Chaeng Watthana Road, near Phranakhon Rajabhat University in Lak Si district, Bangkok. The station has four exits.","th":"สถานีราชภัฏพระนคร เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีชมพู โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนแจ้งวัฒนะในพื้นที่เขตบางเขน กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"2023-11-21","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/MRT_Pink_Line_Rajabhat_Phranakhon_Station_20231203-1.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Rajabhat_Phranakhon_Station_20231203-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Rajabhat_Phranakhon_Station_20231203-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/MRT_Pink_Line_Rajabhat_Phranakhon_Station_20231203-2.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Rajabhat_Phranakhon_Station_20231203-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Rajabhat_Phranakhon_Station_20231203-2.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/MRT_Pink_Line_Rajabhat_Phranakhon_Station_20231203-3.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Rajabhat_Phranakhon_Station_20231203-3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Rajabhat_Phranakhon_Station_20231203-3.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/MRT_Pink_Line_Rajabhat_Phranakhon_Station_20231203-4.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Rajabhat_Phranakhon_Station_20231203-4.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imagein